.git
.gitignore
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv
venv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.sqlite3
staticfiles
backups
media
.claude
.idea
.vscode
# Documentation stays out of the image, with three exceptions the running
# application or its licence needs : the dashboard's "what's new" dialog reads
# CHANGELOG.md, and an AGPL image carries its licence text and its README.
*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!README.md
